  "title": "Emily&#39;s Chipotle Chili",
  "description": "Emily&#39;s slow cooker chipotle chili recipe uses hot Italian sausage, ground beef, tomatoes, beans, spices, and chipotle chiles for a subtle, smoky flavor.",
